<title>BRAZIL: Brazil posts net dlr inflows of $1.048 bln in Feb.</title>
<headline>Brazil posts net dlr inflows of $1.048 bln in Feb.</headline>
<dateline>SAO PAULO 1997-03-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Brazil's commercial and financial foreign exchange transactions showed a preliminary surplus of $1.048 billion in February in the forex commercial market, against a $961 million surplus in January, bankers said.  </p>
<p>Financial buy deals totalled $4.736 billion in February, according to Central Bank data supplied to banks. Financial sell operations amounted to $3.779 billion last month.</p>
<p>Dealers said February contracted exports were $3.370 billion against $3.279 billion in import operations.</p>
<p>((-- Romina Nicaretta, Sao Paulo Newsroom 5511-2485418))</p>
